# Research forensics: archived third-party sources, extracted installs and test
# certificates gathered during investigation. They are not project sources and
# may embed real credentials (gateway passwords, registry auth, SSH logins) or
# private keys, so they must never be committed. Reports stay in docs/research/*.md.
docs/research/_artifacts/
*.pem
*.key